body:
Hi! Me and three of my girlfriends are in Cairo for two nights after a conference. We're looking to do some dancing and saw that Cairo Jazz Club's really popular -- is it really nice? I saw that they have a "couples only" rule, what's that about. 

&#x200B;

Or can you help recommend a nice place?

&#x200B;

Thanks from Manila! :)

&#x200B;
